'''Daybreaker Izanagi''' is a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] gacha event. It was added in [[Version 13.1 Update|Version 13.1]].

